# Requests by service

Tab-separated records have no quoting rules to get wrong — and no way to
carry a tab inside a cell. That trade is the whole format.

```mdv bar
title: Requests by service
x: service
y: requests
format: tsv
---
service	requests
gateway	184320
search	96410
media	54180
auth	31220
```
